<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">BOOKLOOP TEXTBOOK MARKET</view><view class="heading">好教材，继续读。</view><view class="sub">寻找你的下一本课本，也让闲置教材找到新主人。</view><view wx:if="paused" class="error">平台暂时暂停新交易，存量订单与售后仍可处理。</view><view wx:if="mode==='mock'" class="dev-note">内部测试环境 · 所有付款均为模拟</view><view class="search"><input placeholder="搜索教材名称、主题" value="{{q}}" bindinput="input" bindconfirm="search" confirm-type="search"/><button bindtap="search">搜索</button></view><scroll-view scroll-x class="categories"><view class="chip {{!categoryId?'selected':''}}" data-id="" bindtap="category">全部教材</view><view wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="id" class="chip {{categoryId===item.id?'selected':''}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="category">{{item.name}}</view></scroll-view><view wx:for="{{announcements}}" wx:key="id" class="announcement" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="announce"><text>公告</text>{{item.title}}<text class="arrow">›</text></view><view class="section-title"><text>最新上架</text><text>{{total}} 本教材</text></view><view wx:if="error" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="grid"><view wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" class="book" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="detail"><image src="{{item.frontUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view class="book-body"><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view><view class="sub">{{item.condition}}</view><view class="row"><text class="price">¥{{item.yuan}}</text><text class="tag">线下交付</text></view></view></view></view><view wx:if="!products.length&&!loading" class="empty">还没有找到教材<text>
</text>试试其他主题或分类</view><view wx:if="loading" class="loading">正在找教材…</view><view wx:if="products.length&&products.length>=total" class="end">一本教材，连接两位用户</view></view>
